---
title: "C5  One frame (~30 Hz)  —  the funnel runs from scratch every frame"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OSC as OSC in (people)
    participant BEH as BehaviorSystem
    participant V6 as V6Integration
    participant L as PointLight
    participant PG as PanelGrid
    participant ART as Art-Net / LEDs
    participant DB as SQLite + WebSocket

    OSC->>BEH: tracked people + zones (async)
    BEH->>BEH: determine_mode + gestures + trends
    BEH->>V6: behavior_params + status
    V6->>V6: tune meta-params (A7) + falloff shape
    V6-->>L: set brightness_min/max, pulse_speed,<br/>falloff_radius, scale, rotation, move target
    L->>L: update(dt): move toward target + advance pulse<br/>-> current_brightness
    L->>PG: (light state)
    PG->>PG: x12 get_panel_brightness() -> dmx_data[0..11]
    PG->>ART: set 12 channels + show() (universe 0)
    PG-->>DB: record_light_state (0.5-2 s) + broadcast (~15 fps)
    Note over OSC,DB: entire path repeats next frame
